  - every `code`, field code and `constraint` is identical, and only `message` moves, in the 14 cells that carry a rewritten text;
  - both packages' built `.d.ts` are byte-identical;
  - the wrapper and `required: true` were measured end to end on insert and update;
  - the two guard-sentence copies are held equal, proven by ablating each copy separately;
